  "name": "Bond of Greed",
  "type": "spell",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You manifest a link to dragonkind through the mutable power you have with your drachensoul benefactor, and it is so potent that you feel the pull of the Curse more readily.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">When you cast this spell, you can attune to a drachiri benefactor trait you have. Select a type of drachiri benefactor that shares your attuned trait. For the spell’s duration, you gain a +2 status bonus to your AC and saving throw against any effects with that benefactor’s trait and a type of saving throw, but suffer a -2 penalty to a different type of saving throw. You can attune to a different trait in your selected benefactor’s list of traits as a single concentrate action if you have that trait. You can Dismiss this spell.</span></p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.archetypes.OnjCXtm6wpHVtARY]{Effect: Bond of Greed}</p><table border=\"1\" class=\"pf2e lost-omens\"><thead><tr style=\"text-align:right\"><th data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Benefactor</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Curse</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Traits</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Bonus</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Penalty</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Crimson</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Greed of Wealth</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Fire, Wood, Vitality, Water</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Fortitude</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Reflex</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Azure</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Greed of Pride</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Water, Cold, Electricity, Sonic</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Reflex</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Will</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Verdant</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Greed of Envy</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Air, Wood, Acid, Void</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Reflex</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Will</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Ivory</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Greed of Apathy</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Cold, Force, Air, Earth</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Will</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Fortitude</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Ebony</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Greed of Vengeance</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Earth, Metal, Acid, Fire</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Fortitude</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Reflex</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Violet</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"198\"><p>Greed of Pleasure</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Mental, Force, Sonic, Metal</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Will</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"186\"><p>Fortitude</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Heightened (+4) T</strong>he status bonuses and penalty increases by 1.</p>"
